    ],
    "text": "accused of an offence under subsection (1) of section 54A and section 54B-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      579.33,
      526.04,
      592.61
    ],
    "text": "(a) of which the pure quantity of the dangerous drug, trafficked, imported, exported,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      599.97,
      526.04,
      613.25
    ],
    "text": "or possessed is ten grams or above in terms of the report issued by the Government",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      620.73,
      265.37,
      634.01
    ],
    "text": "Analyst under section 77A; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      651.33,
      526.1,
      664.61
    ],
    "text": "(b) Which is punishable with death or life imprisonment, shall not be released on bail",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      672.09,
      405.94,
      685.37
    ],
    "text": "except by the Court of Appeal in exceptional circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      702.81,
      526.01,
      716.09
    ],
    "text": "The statute does not clarify what exceptional circumstances are. When granting bail to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      723.47,
      526.13,
      736.75
    ],
    "text": "suspects under the Ordinance, our Superior Courts have taken into account a number of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      744.23,
      278.35,
      757.51
    ],
    "text": "circumstances that qualify as exceptional.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      781.2,
      525.94,
      805.68
    ],
    "text": "Page 3 of 5",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      72.25,
      519.48,
      85.53
    ],
    "text": "In, Ramu Thamotharampillai V. The Attorney General [2004] 3 SLR 180, it was held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      102.97,
      524.52,
      116.25
    ],
    "text": "\u201cthe decision must in each case depend on its own peculiar facts and circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      133.69,
      495.0,
      146.97
    ],
    "text": "In, Labynidarage Nishanthi V. Attorney General CA (PHC) APN 48/2014), said that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      164.29,
      526.08,
      177.57
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026the term \u201eexceptional circumstances\u201f has not been explained or defined in any of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      185.05,
      526.37,
      198.33
    ],
    "text": "the statutes. Judges are given a wide discretion in deciding in what creates a circumstance",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      205.69,
      218.33,
      218.97
    ],
    "text": "which exceptional in nature.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      236.44,
      526.4,
      249.72
    ],
    "text": "In, Welathanthrage Amila Sampath Botheju V. Attorney General CA/BAL/0239/23, it was",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      257.2,
      120.02,
      270.48
    ],
    "text": "held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      287.92,
      526.1,
      301.2
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026a certain situation amounts to exceptional circumstances or not, has to be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      308.56,
      468.1,
      321.84
    ],
    "text": "considered on a case-by-case basis, unique to each application before the court.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      339.28,
      526.2,
      352.56
    ],
    "text": "When applied in relation to the material before us, in paragraph 09 of the petition, the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      359.92,
      526.03,
      373.2
    ],
    "text": "petitioner pleads certain grounds which are alleged as exceptional grounds and they are as",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      380.68,
      114.38,
      393.96
    ],
    "text": "follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.02,
      411.25,
      526.11,
      424.7
    ],
